// Generated by the material3 skill screenshot step (scripts/screenshot/compose.mjs). It is compiled
// only in a temporary copy of the project, as a unit test of the app module.
//
// Launches the app's launcher activity under Robolectric native graphics at 412x915dp / 420dpi, light
// and +night, and per theme:
//   frames  <theme>-412x915-<nn>.png: the top of the screen, then the first vertical scrollable moved
//           one viewport down each time (4 frames at most); ATF hierarchy checks and the clickable
//           Compose nodes under 48dp for every frame -> runtime-<theme>.json
//   states  (with -Dm3.statesFile) one fresh launch per state, the steps (click, enterText, scrollTo,
//           waitMs) performed through the Compose semantics actions, then state-<name>-<theme>-412x915.png
//           and state-<name>-<theme>.json { ok, error?, file? }. A failing step never throws.
package m3shots

import android.content.Context
import android.content.Intent
import android.graphics.Bitmap
import android.graphics.BitmapFactory
import android.graphics.Canvas
import android.graphics.Color
import android.graphics.Paint
